# 8. How do you write an effective defect title?

### Interview Answer

A good defect title should be:

* Short
* Specific
* Clear
* Action-oriented
* Easy to understand

### Poor Title

```text
Add vehicle not working
```

### Better Title

```text
Continue button remains disabled when user enters a valid VIN in Add Vehicle flow
```

The second title immediately tells the developer what is failing and under what condition.

