# 25. How do you handle a production defect?

### Interview Answer

Production defects require immediate attention based on business impact.

My approach would be:

```text
Detect
 ↓
Validate
 ↓
Assess Impact
 ↓
Determine Severity
 ↓
Notify Stakeholders
 ↓
Investigate
 ↓
Identify Workaround
 ↓
Fix
 ↓
Retest
 ↓
Targeted Regression
 ↓
Deploy
 ↓
Monitor
```

I would also participate in root cause analysis and identify how the defect escaped testing.

