# 30. What if a defect occurs only in Production but not Stage?

### Interview Answer

I would compare the environments.

I would investigate:

```text
Application version
Configuration
Database
API version
Feature flags
Environment variables
Third-party integrations
Authentication
Network
Data
Infrastructure
```

I would also compare logs from both environments.

### Senior-Level Answer

> "I would treat environment differences as a primary investigation path rather than assuming the application code is necessarily the problem."

