# 31. What if a defect occurs only on one browser?

### Interview Answer

I would first reproduce it on the same browser and version.

Then I would compare:

```text
Chrome
Edge
Firefox
Safari
```

I would check:

* Browser version
* OS
* JavaScript behavior
* Browser console
* Network requests
* CSS rendering
* Cookies
* Local storage
* Browser permissions

Then I would determine whether it is a browser compatibility defect.

