# 32. What if a defect occurs only on mobile?

### Interview Answer

I would compare:

```text
Android vs iOS
Different OS versions
Different devices
Different screen sizes
Different network conditions
Application versions
```

I would capture:

* Device model
* OS version
* App version
* Logs
* Screenshots
* Screen recording
