### Interview Question

> "You find a critical defect two hours before production deployment. What do you do?"

### Strong Answer

I would immediately validate the defect and determine its business impact.

Then I would:

```text
Validate
 ↓
Document
 ↓
Assign Severity/Priority
 ↓
Notify Stakeholders
 ↓
Discuss Release Risk
 ↓
Fix or Decision
