# 56. Senior-Level Scenario: You have 500 test cases but only one hour

### Interview Question

> "How would you test a release when you have very limited time?"

### Strong Answer

I would use **risk-based testing**.

I would prioritize:

```text
P0/P1 business flows
↓
Recently changed functionality
↓
Integration points
↓
Previously unstable areas
↓
Critical customer workflows
↓
Smoke tests
```

I would not blindly execute all 500 test cases.

I would communicate:

```text
What was tested
What was not tested
Known defects
Remaining risks
Release recommendation
```

